# Copy this file to .env and adjust for your environment.
# Never commit the real .env file — see .gitignore.

# Base URL of the IMH LVS backend (see backend/README.md). Used for label
# extraction (POST /api/labels/extract) via src/services/labelExtractionService.ts.
# No trailing slash. This is baked into the build at build time (it's a
# Vite env var), so it must be set correctly wherever the frontend is built.

# --- Local development ---
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000

# --- Production (e.g. Vercel) ---
# Do NOT hardcode this in source. Set VITE_API_BASE_URL as an environment
# variable in the hosting platform's project settings (e.g. Vercel ->
# Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables) to the backend's public,
# HTTPS URL, then redeploy. A missing/unset value falls back to
# http://localhost:4000, which does not exist on a visitor's machine and
# will make label extraction fail with "Label reading service is currently
# unavailable" on every deployed environment.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://<your-backend-domain>
